 administrative identity gate accepts a repository administrator or site administrator and otherwise returns forbidden.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-abc290f763b410ea","startLine":4,"endLine":11}]},{"id":"f-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler resolves the target issue from the repository and the route's issue index, returning on lookup error.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ed35041e326128c5","startLine":42,"endLine":47}]},{"id":"f-admin-control","kind":"control","statement":"The reqAdmin route guard blocks a caller who is neither a repository administrator nor a site administrator.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-abc290f763b410ea","startLine":5,"endLine":10}]},{"id":"f-write-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"After issue lookup, the handler requires issue or pull-request write permission and returns forbidden when that permission is absent.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ed35041e326128c5","startLine":49,"endLine":52}]},{"id":"f-lock-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"For an unlocked issue, the handler constructs lock options and invokes the issue lock operation; successful processing then returns no content.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ed35041e326128c5","startLine":54,"endLine":69}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":2785,"output":704,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":17285.5208,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T13:01:06.193Z"}}
